teacher she is an authority on the pleasures of the well-trodden path and the
thrill of the road less travelled. She also delights in the challenge of exploring
totally Ъ territory.
As a ন teacher at New York University I recommend a broad
spectrum of textbooks to my students. I tend to the view that most of these
books offer something of value and each of them is ผ as good as
the person who reads them. In the case of ║ し’s work I make
